    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Stuck in the bunker. Again. Begged my superior officer to let me go and explore the terrain, but he was having none of it. It's hostile, he says. No it isn't! I see other species out there all the time. Just yesterday, I saw a walking, talking bird hanging out with a large monkey.",
    "value": "困在地堡里。日复一日。我恳求上司放我出去勘察地形，但他根本听不进去。“外面很危险，”他说。才不危险呢！我经常看到外面有其他物种。就在昨天，我还看见一只能走会说的鸟，跟一只大猴子待在一块儿。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "I told my superior officer this and he suggested I visit the med bay. I'll send HIM to the med bay if he doesn't start taking me seriously. Tempers sure are getting frayed around here. Let's hope we don't have any friendly fire incidents.",
    "value": "我把这事告诉了上司，你猜他怎么说？他建议我去医务室看看。要是他再这么不把我当回事，我就送他进医务室！这儿的火气真是越来越大了。但愿别闹出什么友军误伤。"
  }
